// coordinate that replaced SOFT is linear near the origin, so those same 1.6
// points now arrive at their full value on BOTH coordinates and in both
// innings: measured, two identical sides split 61.7/38.3, which is the ground
// deciding the match rather than nudging it.
//
// It went to 0.55 first, and then the relative contest itself was damped by a
// third when a five-point squad gap was found to be winning 98% of matches - at
// which point 0.55 points bought so little that identical sides came back BELOW
// even and the host's edge was inside the noise. 1.05 is where it lands with the
// contest at its final strength: measured over 800 identical fixtures across two
