// ---- WHAT STANDARD OF CRICKET THIS MATCH IS, read once off the two squads ---
//
// THE BUG THIS EXISTS FOR. The standard term used to read the SUM of the two
// men on this particular delivery, and that is not what a standard is. Measured
// over two hundred matches with one bowler swept from wicket 50 to wicket 95
// and every other man in both sides held fixed:
//
//     wicket 50   economy 5.16   average 24.3
//     wicket 95   economy 5.53   average 32.9
